name 'thinking-critically-about-ai-preassessment-q2_2026-pilot_2026'

question 'A student uses a navigation app that automatically suggests a faster route based on traffic. Which type of AI is this an example of?'
wrong 'A visible AI, because you can see the map on screen.'
wrong 'A helpful AI only if the student is driving somewhere new.'
right 'A hidden AI, because it works in the background without the user directly asking it to.'
wrong 'A risky AI, because navigation apps are always dangerous.'

allow_multiple_attempts true

